   "id": "stats",
   "titulo": {
    "en": "Stats, Limits and Starting Values",
    "es": "Dotes, límites y valores iniciales",
    "pt": "Atributos, limites e valores iniciais"
   },
   "html": {
    "en": "<p>Every new game starts from the same numbers. They never change between playthroughs.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Girl</th><th>POWER</th><th>WILL</th><th>SWORD</th><th>MAGIC</th><th>GRACE</th><th>MIND</th><th>ART</th><th>CHARM</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Hikaru</td><td>50</td><td>30</td><td>30</td><td>40</td><td>40</td><td>37</td><td>32</td><td>36</td></tr><tr><td>Umi</td><td>50</td><td>30</td><td>38</td><td>25</td><td>40</td><td>39</td><td>38</td><td>35</td></tr><tr><td>Fuu</td><td>50</td><td>30</td><td>30</td><td>30</td><td>40</td><td>43</td><td>34</td><td>38</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Limits</h3><ul><li><strong>POWER</strong> and <strong>WILL</strong> run from 1 to 100. Lessons spend them; Nap, rest spots and the spring restore them.</li><li><strong>SWORD, MAGIC, GRACE, MIND, ART, CHARM</strong> stop at <strong>80</strong>. With that stat&rsquo;s Plus 1 item they can reach <strong>100</strong>.</li><li>The same six can drop as low as <strong>&minus;27</strong>. A girl who only naps ends the game with CHARM &minus;27.</li><li>Items belong to the team. One Escudo raises the SWORD limit of all three girls.</li></ul><div class=\"guia-figs\"><figure class=\"man-fig\"><div class=\"crt\"><img src=\"shots/mkr2/manual/parametros_hik.png\" data-shot=\"mkr2/manual/parametros_hik.png\" alt=\"The Stats screen\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>The Stats screen</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"man-fig\"><div class=\"crt\"><img src=\"shots/mkr2/guia/av_painel.png\" data-shot=\"mkr2/guia/av_painel.png\" alt=\"The same stats, short form, on an adventure\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>The same stats, short form, on an adventure</figcaption></figure></div><h3>What each stat is for</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Stat</th><th>Decides</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>SWORD</td><td>Fencer / Warrior jobs, battles, the tourney, Sang Yun&rsquo;s test in the Town</td></tr><tr><td>MAGIC</td><td>Mage job, battles, the tourney, Summoner and Explorer, crossing the mountain river</td></tr><tr><td>GRACE</td><td>Priest job, Bride and Nurse, the Town priest&rsquo;s test, healing the dog in the Forest</td></tr><tr><td>MIND</td><td>Sleuth job, Farmer and Nurse, the Imp&rsquo;s test in the Town</td></tr><tr><td>ART</td><td>Minstrel / Smith / Artist jobs, Clown and Farmer, the musician, painting on the Mountain</td></tr><tr><td>CHARM</td><td>Dancer job, Summoner, Clown and Bride, the dance party, the mountain beauty</td></tr></tbody></table>",
    "es": "<p>Toda partida nueva empieza con los mismos números. Nunca cambian de una partida a otra.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Chica</th><th>VIGOR</th><th>ÁNIMO</th><th>SABLE</th><th>MAGIA</th><th>CLASE</th><th>MENTE</th><th>ARTE</th><th>GARBO</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Lucy</td><td>50</td><td>30</td><td>30</td><td>40</td><td>40</td><td>37</td><td>32</td><td>36</td></tr><tr><td>Marina</td><td>50</td><td>30</td><td>38</td><td>25</td><td>40</td><td>39</td><td>38</td><td>35</td></tr><tr><td>Anaís</td><td>50</td><td>30</td><td>30</td><td>30</td><td>40</td><td>43</td><td>34</td><td>38</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Límites</h3><ul><li><strong>VIGOR</strong> y <strong>ÁNIMO</strong> van de 1 a 100. Las lecciones los gastan; Dormir, los lugares de descanso y el manantial los recuperan.</li><li><strong>SABLE, MAGIA, CLASE, MENTE, ARTE, GARBO</strong> se detienen en <strong>80</strong>. Con el extra de esa dote pueden llegar a <strong>100</strong>.</li><li>Esas seis también pueden bajar hasta <strong>−27</strong>. Una chica que solo duerme termina el juego con GARBO −27.</li><li>Los objetos son del equipo. Un solo Escudo sube el límite de SABLE de las tres chicas.</li></ul><div class=\"guia-figs\"><figure class=\"man-fig\"><div class=\"crt\"><img src=\"shots/mkr2/manual/parametros_hik.png\" data-shot=\"mkr2/manual/parametros_hik.png\" alt=\"La pantalla de Dotes\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>La pantalla de Dotes</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"man-fig\"><div class=\"crt\"><img src=\"shots/mkr2/guia/av_painel.png\" data-shot=\"mkr2/guia/av_painel.png\" alt=\"Las mismas dotes, abreviadas, en una aventura\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>Las mismas dotes, abreviadas, en una aventura</figcaption></figure></div><h3>Para qué sirve cada dote</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Dote</th><th>Decide</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>SABLE</td><td>Oficios de espadachina / luchadora, peleas, el torneo, la prueba de Sanyun en el pueblo</td></tr><tr><td>MAGIA</td><td>Oficio de maga, peleas, el torneo, invocadora y exploradora, cruzar el río del monte</td></tr><tr><td>CLASE</td><td>Oficio de sacerdotisa, novia y enfermera, la prueba del sacerdote del pueblo, curar al perro en el bosque</td></tr><tr><td>MENTE</td><td>Oficio de detective, granjera y enfermera, la prueba del Duende en el pueblo</td></tr><tr><td>ARTE</td><td>Oficios de juglaresa / artesana / artista, payasa y granjera, el músico, pintar en el monte</td></tr><tr><td>GARBO</td><td>Oficio de danzante, invocadora, payasa y novia, el baile, la belleza del monte</td></tr></tbody></table>",
    "pt": "<p>Todo jogo novo começa com os mesmos números. Eles nunca mudam de uma jogatina para outra.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Garota</th><th>POWER</th><th>WILL</th><th>SWORD</th><th>MAGIC</th><th>GRACE</th><th>MIND</th><th>ART</th><th>CHARM</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Hikaru</td><td>50</td><td>30</td><td>30</td><td>40</td><td>40</td><td>37</td><td>32</td><td>36</td></tr><tr><td>Umi</td><td>50</td><td>30</td><td>38</td><td>25</td><td>40</td><td>39</td><td>38</td><td>35</td></tr><tr><td>Fuu</td><td>50</td><td>30</td><td>30</td><td>30</td><td>40</td><td>43</td><td>34</td><td>38</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Limites</h3><ul><li><strong>POWER</strong> (energia) e <strong>WILL</strong> (vontade) vão de 1 a 100. As lições gastam os dois; Nap, pontos de descanso e a fonte recuperam.</li><li><strong>SWORD, MAGIC, GRACE, MIND, ART, CHARM</strong> param em <strong>80</strong>. Com o item Plus 1 do atributo, chegam a <strong>100</strong>.</li><li>Esses mesmos seis podem cair até <strong>&minus;27</strong>. Uma garota que só dorme termina o jogo com CHARM &minus;27.</li><li>Os itens são da equipe. Um Escudo sobe o limite de SWORD das três garotas.</li></ul><div class=\"guia-figs\"><figure class=\"man-fig\"><div class=\"crt\"><img src=\"shots/mkr2/manual/parametros_hik.png\" data-shot=\"mkr2/manual/parametros_hik.png\" alt=\"A tela Stats\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>A tela Stats</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"man-fig\"><div class=\"crt\"><img src=\"shots/mkr2/guia/av_painel.png\" data-shot=\"mkr2/guia/av_painel.png\" alt=\"Os mesmos atributos, abreviados, numa aventura\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption>Os mesmos atributos, abreviados, numa aventura</figcaption></figure></div><h3>Para que serve cada atributo</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Atributo</th><th>Decide</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>SWORD</td><td>Profissões Fencer / Warrior, batalhas, o torneio, o teste do Sang Yun na Vila</td></tr><tr><td>MAGIC</td><td>Profissão Mage, batalhas, o torneio, Summoner e Explorer, atravessar o rio da montanha</td></tr><tr><td>GRACE</td><td>Profissão Priest, Bride e Nurse, o teste do sacerdote da Vila, curar o cachorro na Floresta</td></tr><tr><td>MIND</td><td>Profissão Sleuth, Farmer e Nurse, o teste do Imp na Vila</td></tr><tr><td>ART</td><td>Profissões Minstrel / Smith / Artist, Clown e Farmer, o músico, pintar na Montanha</td></tr><tr><td>CHARM</td><td>Profissão Dancer, Summoner, Clown e Bride, o baile, a beldade da montanha</td></tr></tbody></table>"
   }
